---
description: TypeScript layout, environment validation and component conventions.
globs: "**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---
Use single-line-call-params and no-compat-re-exports when applicable. Keep named types in *.types.ts and import them with import type. Leave blank lines between import groups, declarations/functions, and logical setup/action/return blocks. Oxlint style/* and Oxfmt enforce the checked-in conventions. Use explicit JSX conditionals; no && rendering. Environment variables belong in the Zod schemas and derived env.types.ts, not ad hoc casts.
